I often use boulders for stashes. Engrave Elbereth with a
hard gem and push the boulder over the stash. You would need
stray shot from a /oStriking quickly followed by a monster
that doesn't respect Elbereth to have a problem.

My preferences are 1) a container in a locked closet, a
container, a locked closet, under a boulder, a stack near
the exit from a branch like Sokoban, stacked in corner near
the stairs, all with Elbereth and, if available, a cursed
item on top so my pet won't move things off the Elbereth.
The stack in the open on normal dungeon levels are a little
risky, but since nothing happens on a level when you aren't
there, it's not a terrible risk.
